</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/59731162-994c-11f1-9c8d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-13T025419Z-703380743-RC2EXMACGFQ6-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-ZHU-RONGJI.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/59731162-994c-11f1-9c8d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-13T025419Z-703380743-RC2EXMACGFQ6-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-ZHU-RONGJI.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">01abe916-9949-11f1-a6d4-2da5385bd1e6</guid><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:28:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/59731162-994c-11f1-9c8d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-13T025419Z-703380743-RC2EXMACGFQ6-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-ZHU-RONGJI.jpg">© 路透社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>日本首相高市早苗遥拜靖国神社</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260816-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E9%A6%96%E7%9B%B8%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97%E9%81%A5%E6%8B%9C%E9%9D%96%E5%9B%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%A4%BE</link><description>
